results:

* `TheoremA` (Theorem A = Theorem 4.4): for a subcategory `Z` of the category
  `mod Λ` of finite-dimensional right modules over a finite-dimensional algebra
  `Λ`, the following are equivalent: `Z` is image-closed; `Z = Gen Z ∩ Cogen Z`;
